<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-chenshu" book-id="b-chenshu-005" chapter-id="c-chenshu-005-shenjunli-office-death" source-id="s-chenshu-005-shenjunli-office-death-ws2374950">
  <p id="c-chenshu-005-shenjunli-office-death:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">太子詹事、駙馬都尉<persName id="c-chenshu-005-shenjunli-office-death:p001:m0009" ref="9wm_vgh_vz1_AA">沈君理</persName>為吏部尚書。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-005-shenjunli-office-death:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">秋七月辛卯，<persName id="c-chenshu-005-shenjunli-office-death:p002:m0006" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_A">皇太子</persName>納妃<persName id="c-chenshu-005-shenjunli-office-death:p002:m0011" ref="9wm_vgh_vz1_AAA">沈氏</persName></p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-005-shenjunli-office-death:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">吏部尚書、駙馬都尉<persName id="c-chenshu-005-shenjunli-office-death:p003:m0009" ref="9wm_vgh_vz1_AA">沈君理</persName>為尚書右僕射，領吏部。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-005-shenjunli-office-death:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">癸未，尚書右僕射、領吏部、駙馬都尉<persName id="c-chenshu-005-shenjunli-office-death:p004:m0017" ref="9wm_vgh_vz1_AA">沈君理</persName>卒。</p>
</text>
